#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization by configuring IAM, "
"resource groups, and access groups."
msgstr ""
"I-configure ang IBM Quantum Platform para sa isang organisasyon sa "
"pamamagitan ng pag-configure ng IAM, resource groups, at access groups."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization"
msgstr "I-configure ang IBM Quantum Platform para sa isang organisasyon"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Configure IBM Quantum Platform for an organization {#configure-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-for-an-organization}"
msgstr ""
"I-configure ang IBM Quantum Platform para sa isang organisasyon {#configure-"
"ibm-quantum-platform-for-an-organization}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to set up IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para i-set up ang IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"iam-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Configure IAM settings {#1-configure-iam-settings}"
msgstr "1. I-configure ang mga setting ng IAM {#1-configure-iam-settings}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, configure the following settings in the administrator's IAM account. "
"To review and configure these settings, go to [Manage → IAM → "
"Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, i-configure ang mga sumusunod na setting sa IAM account ng "
"administrator. Para suriin at i-configure ang mga setting na ito, pumunta sa"
" [Manage → IAM → Settings](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/settings).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**User list visibility** determines whether users can see each other, "
"regardless of project assignment. The `enabled` setting restricts user "
"visibility. That is, users in your account cannot see each other, even if "
"they can access the same resources. Choose the appropriate value for your "
"environment. See [Controlling user "
"visibility](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-"
"setting) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"**User list visibility** — tinutukoy nito kung makikita ng mga user ang "
"isa't isa, anuman ang project assignment. Ang setting na `enabled` ay nagre-"
"restrict ng visibility ng user. Ibig sabihin, hindi makikita ng mga user sa "
"iyong account ang isa't isa, kahit na may access sila sa parehong mga "
"resources. Piliin ang angkop na value para sa iyong environment. Tingnan ang"
" [Controlling user "
"visibility](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iam-user-"
"setting) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**API key creation** controls whether users can create API keys. In IBM "
"Quantum Platform, it is common to use API keys. If API keys are being used, "
"choose `disabled`. Alternatively, you can give specific permissions to each "
"user.\n"
msgstr ""
"**API key creation** — kinokontrol nito kung maaaring gumawa ng API keys ang"
" mga user. Sa IBM Quantum Platform, karaniwan ang paggamit ng API keys. Kung"
" ginagamit ang API keys, piliin ang `disabled`. Bilang alternatibo, maaari "
"kang magbigay ng mga partikular na permiso sa bawat user.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"crt-rsc-grp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. (Optional) Create resource groups {#2-optional-create-resource-groups}"
msgstr ""
"2. (Opsyonal) Gumawa ng mga resource group {#2-optional-create-resource-"
"groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Skip this step if you are using access groups that directly reference IBM "
"Quantum service instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"Laktawan ang hakbang na ito kung gumagamit ka ng mga access group na "
"direktang nagre-reference ng mga IBM Quantum service instance.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you chose to use resource groups, go to [Manage → Account → Resource "
"groups (in Account resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-"
"groups) and click **Create**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung pinili mong gumamit ng mga resource group, pumunta sa [Manage → Account"
" → Resource groups (in Account "
"resources)](https://cloud.ibm.com/account/resource-groups) at i-click ang "
"**Create**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-instance-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Create IBM Quantum service instances {#3-create-ibm-quantum-service-"
"instances}"
msgstr ""
"3. Gumawa ng mga IBM Quantum service instance {#3-create-ibm-quantum-"
"service-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you already created IBM Quantum service instances, skip this step.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung nakagawa ka na ng mga IBM Quantum service instance, laktawan ang "
"hakbang na ito.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using resource groups, make sure to create the service instances "
"on the appropriate resource group.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung gumagamit ka ng mga resource group, siguraduhing gawin ang mga service "
"instance sa angkop na resource group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The service instance name, such as `QR-ml`, is needed for access group "
"references.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pangalan ng service instance, tulad ng `QR-ml`, ay kailangan para sa mga"
" reference ng access group.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup#cloud) for"
" instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga hakbang sa [Set up to use IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-"
"setup#cloud) para sa mga tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"create-group-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Create access groups for projects {#4-create-access-groups-for-projects}"
msgstr ""
"4. Gumawa ng mga access group para sa mga proyekto {#4-create-access-groups-"
"for-projects}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, [create a custom role](/guides/custom-roles#custom) that allows users to perform actions to work with IBM Quantum service instances.\n"
"Next, [create an access group](/guides/access-groups) for each project and give that group the minimum set of permissions that are required to work with the project resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Una, [gumawa ng custom role](/guides/custom-roles#custom) na nagbibigay-daan sa mga user na magsagawa ng mga aksyon para magtrabaho gamit ang mga IBM Quantum service instance.\n"
"Susunod, [gumawa ng access group](/guides/access-groups) para sa bawat proyekto at bigyan ang group na iyon ng pinakamaliit na hanay ng mga permisong kailangan para magtrabaho sa mga resources ng proyekto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"setup-idp-org\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Set up your ID provider and assign users {#5-set-up-your-id-provider-and-"
"assign-users}"
msgstr ""
"5. I-set up ang iyong ID provider at mag-assign ng mga user {#5-set-up-your-"
"id-provider-and-assign-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the appropriate topic, depending on the ID provider you "
"chose to use:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sundin ang mga hakbang sa angkop na paksa, depende sa ID provider na pinili "
"mong gamitin:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud&reg; as the ID provider for users that have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gamitin ang IBM Cloud&reg; bilang ID provider para sa mga user na may IBM "
"Cloud account](/guides/manage-cloud-users)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use IBM Cloud as the ID provider for users that do not have IBM Cloud "
"accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gamitin ang IBM Cloud bilang ID provider para sa mga user na walang IBM "
"Cloud account](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Use an ID provider other than IBM Cloud for users that do not have IBM "
"Cloud accounts](/guides/manage-appid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gamitin ang isang ID provider bukod sa IBM Cloud para sa mga user na walang"
" IBM Cloud account](/guides/manage-appid)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Invite users and manage their access](/guides/invite-and-manage-users)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Mag-invite ng mga user at pamahalaan ang kanilang access](/guides/invite-"
"and-manage-users)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"firewall\"></span>\n"
